  "short_description": "<p>A premium ceramic dish with a handwoven rattan frame. Handmade in Vietnam, ideal for restaurants, table decor, or gifting. Wholesale inquiries welcome.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"629\">This elegant <strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"396\">ceramic dish with handwoven rattan frame</strong> combines the best of two worlds: durable ceramic and natural rattan weaving. Each piece is meticulously handcrafted by Vietnamese artisans, making it a unique and sustainable solution for restaurants, hotels, or eco-conscious homes.</p>\n<p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"886\">The smooth ceramic base features a detailed radial pattern, while the rattan-wrapped border provides a warm, rustic touch. Lightweight, functional, and stylish, this dish is perfect for serving appetizers, bread, snacks, or as a decorative catch-all tray.</p>\n<p data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"1078\">As a leading <strong data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"940\">manufacturer and wholesale supplier</strong> in Vietnam, <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"984\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong> offers bulk customization and private label options for this beautiful ceramic-rattan fusion.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1083\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1109\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1107\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1443\">\n<li data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1171\">\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1171\">Ceramic base with high-temperature glazing for durability</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1227\">\n<p data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1227\">Handwoven natural rattan edge for an artisan finish</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1278\">\n<p data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1278\">Available in custom shapes, sizes, and designs</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1339\">\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1339\">Perfect for restaurants, boutique hotels, and gift shops</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1388\">\n<p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1388\">100% handmade by skilled artisans in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1443\">\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1443\">Eco-conscious and biodegradable outer rattan frame</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1448\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1485\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1483\">Craftsmanship &amp; Impact:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1765\">Vietnamese handicrafts like this item use <strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1575\">100% domestic raw materials and local labor</strong>, generating foreign exchange income for the country and creating jobs for farmers in their free time between harvests. This dish reflects both sustainability and Vietnamese cultural values.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1770\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1806\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1804\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1952\">📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1840\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1843\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1899\">www.vietcraft.vn</a><br data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1902\" />📦 Bulk order pricing &amp; MOQ available upon request</p>\n<p data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2149\">",
